[
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "欢迎来到KC桌面。今天我们用一份最新\n研报，拆一个值得继续跟踪的问题。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 6.455,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "KC桌面",
      "研报"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "最近美联储的动向有点让人摸不着头脑，\n之前大家还在讨论降息，现在怎么突然就\n变了？",
    "start": 6.815,
    "end": 15.732,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "美联储",
      "降息"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "对，这就是今天我们要聊的核心。一份最\n新的投行研报直接推翻了自己之前的预测\n，从预计两次降息，",
    "start": 16.092,
    "end": 27.144,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "投行研报",
      "两次降息"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "变成了无限期维持利率不变。",
    "start": 27.504,
    "end": 30.198,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "无限期",
      "利率不变"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "无限期？这个转变也太大了。报告里到底\n发现了什么，让这些分析师做出这么鹰派\n的判断？",
    "start": 30.558,
    "end": 38.081,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "鹰派"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "简单说，就是数据太强了，通胀压力又回\n来了。报告认为，经济增长依然稳健，研\n究和消费都很强劲，",
    "start": 38.441,
    "end": 47.915,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "数据",
      "通胀压力",
      "经济增长"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "同时价格压力正在重新积聚。",
    "start": 48.275,
    "end": 50.922,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "价格压力"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "所以，这份报告真正要回答的问题，就是\n“为什么降息预期彻底落空了”，对吧？",
    "start": 51.282,
    "end": 58.527,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "降息预期"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "没错。它解释了为什么市场之前期待的降\n息窗口，现在看可能根本不会出现。而且\n，政策环境压力也减弱了。",
    "start": 58.887,
    "end": 69.753,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "降息窗口",
      "政策环境压力"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "政策环境压力？你是说特朗普政策端之前\n一直施压降息？",
    "start": 70.113,
    "end": 75.547,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "特朗普",
      "施压降息"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "对，但报告引用了一个采访，说特朗普本\n人似乎已经接受短期内不降息了，还表示\n会让新任美联储主席沃什自己决定。",
    "start": 75.907,
    "end": 88.771,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "特朗普",
      "不降息",
      "沃什"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "那沃什本人呢？他不是被认为是偏鸽派的\n吗？",
    "start": 89.131,
    "end": 92.707,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "沃什",
      "鸽派"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "他是可能想降息，但问题在于，支持降息\n的官员越来越少了。报告特别提到，连之\n前偏鸽派的官员，",
    "start": 93.067,
    "end": 102.54,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "降息",
      "官员"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "现在都不再主张降息了。",
    "start": 102.9,
    "end": 104.897,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "降息"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "这很有意思。能举几个具体例子吗？",
    "start": 105.257,
    "end": 108.369,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "这很有意思",
      "能举几个具体"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "比如美联储理事沃勒，他最近讲话很鹰派\n，直接说通胀风险上升，劳动力市场稳定\n，",
    "start": 108.729,
    "end": 116.624,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "沃勒",
      "鹰派",
      "通胀风险"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "降息和加息的可能性已经差不多了。他甚\n至认为应该取消政策声明里“偏宽松”的\n措辞。",
    "start": 116.984,
    "end": 125.203,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "降息",
      "加息",
      "偏宽松"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "所以，美联储内部的风向已经彻底变了。\n那除了官员表态，数据上有什么支撑吗？",
    "start": 125.563,
    "end": 133.133,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "美联储",
      "数据"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "数据是核心。报告指出，制造业PMI创\n了多年新高，企业资本开支也在加速，不\n只是AI领域。还有，",
    "start": 133.493,
    "end": 143.71,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "制造业PMI",
      "企业资本开支",
      "AI"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "初请失业金人数在传统上会上升的夏季，\n反而保持平稳，这说明就业市场很强劲。",
    "start": 144.07,
    "end": 152.15,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "初请失业金人数",
      "就业市场"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "那通胀呢？我们一直说通胀在回落，现在\n又怎么了？",
    "start": 152.51,
    "end": 156.876,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "通胀"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "这才是最关键的。报告提到，尽管关税带\n来的通胀在消退，但新的压力出现了，比\n如伊朗战争和全球芯片短缺。",
    "start": 157.236,
    "end": 168.335,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "关税",
      "伊朗战争",
      "芯片短缺"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "更直观的是，制造业PMI的投入价格指\n数飙升到了79.5，这是有史以来单月\n最大涨幅。",
    "start": 168.695,
    "end": 177.426,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "制造业PMI",
      "投入价格指数",
      "79.5"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "5？这个数字太夸张了。这意味着企业成\n本在快速上升，最终会传导到消费者身上\n。",
    "start": 177.786,
    "end": 188.699,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "企业成本"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "对。而且报告还预测，核心PCE通胀在\n4月份会继续上升，同比可能达到3.3\n%。",
    "start": 189.059,
    "end": 196.675,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "核心PCE通胀",
      "3.3%"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "这离美联储2%的目标越来越远了。",
    "start": 197.035,
    "end": 200.518,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "2%"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "所以，降息不仅没戏，甚至有人开始讨论\n加息了？",
    "start": 200.878,
    "end": 205.429,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "降息",
      "加息"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "报告里确实提到，大多数官员认为，如果\n通胀持续高于2%，可能需要收紧政策。\n不过，",
    "start": 205.789,
    "end": 213.823,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "通胀",
      "2%",
      "收紧政策"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "报告自己的预测是无限期暂停，并没有直\n接预测加息。",
    "start": 214.183,
    "end": 219.385,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "无限期暂停",
      "加息"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "那这份报告里，还有没有哪些问题没有完\n全展开，值得我们去读完整版？",
    "start": 219.745,
    "end": 226.293,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "那这份报告里",
      "还有没有哪些"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "有两点。第一，报告提到了“超级核心P\nCE”通胀，也就是剔除住房后的服务通\n胀，这个指标在4月有所放缓，",
    "start": 226.653,
    "end": 236.73,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "超级核心PCE",
      "服务通胀"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "但报告暗示，5月可能会因为股市强劲而\n反弹。为什么？完整报告里有详细分析。",
    "start": 237.09,
    "end": 245.821,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "股市"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "这个悬念留得好。那第二点呢？",
    "start": 246.181,
    "end": 249.107,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "这个悬念留得",
      "那第二点呢"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "第二点是关于新任主席沃什。报告说他可\n能想降息，但现实是他很难说服委员会。\n那么，",
    "start": 249.467,
    "end": 258.476,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "沃什",
      "降息",
      "委员会"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "他到底会用什么样的策略来推动政策？完\n整报告里对美联储内部的博弈有更深入的\n讨论。",
    "start": 258.836,
    "end": 266.777,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "美联储",
      "博弈"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "明白了。看来要理解美联储下一步的动向\n，光看表面数据是不够的，还得读懂内部\n的权力平衡和官员们的真实想法。",
    "start": 267.137,
    "end": 278.84,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "美联储",
      "权力平衡"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "没错。如果你对这份完整的研报感兴趣，\n可以加入我们的社群，或者直接阅读报告\n全文，里面的图表和数据非常详尽，",
    "start": 279.2,
    "end": 291.089,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "研报",
      "图表",
      "数据"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "能帮你更系统地理解当前的宏观环境。",
    "start": 291.449,
    "end": 294.932,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "宏观环境"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "好，那我们今天就聊到这里。感谢收听，\n我们下期再见。",
    "start": 295.292,
    "end": 300.261,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "那我们今天就",
      "聊到这里"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  }
]